      {
        "id": 264998,
        "name": "Chief Lackey Rich",
        "username": "Chief_Lackey_Rich",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/6de8d8/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2026-02-01T16:07:40.877Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Chief_Lackey_Rich\" data-post=\"44\" data-topic=\"29635\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/6de8d8/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Chief_Lackey_Rich:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The omniverse really needs a crossover where Orbo, Ego, Unicron and Mogo meet up. Maybe they could watch Star Wars and criticize the Death Star(s) for being wimps.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>How did I miss the opportunity to have them all orbiting Solaris the Tyrant Sun so I could drag another celestial-body-sized character into this?  There’s a weirdly large number of them out there.</p>",
