      {
        "id": 265023,
        "name": "",
        "username": "fjur",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/fjur/{size}/4849_2.png",
        "created_at": "2026-02-03T03:01:54.772Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Chief_Lackey_Rich\" data-post=\"71\" data-topic=\"29635\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/6de8d8/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Chief_Lackey_Rich:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Nice to be reminded it’s here, regardless.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yeah, I do regret that I’ve not had enough free time to do more projects of this sort, but <em>c’est la vie</em>.</p>\n<p>That being said, I have recently begun my first actual honest-to-goodness long-form, not one-shot/limited series <em><strong>SCRPG</strong></em> game, so there’s some chance that I may post some of the things I make for that.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Chief_Lackey_Rich\" data-post=\"72\" data-topic=\"29635\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/6de8d8/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Chief_Lackey_Rich:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>How did I miss the opportunity to have them all orbiting Solaris the Tyrant Sun so I could drag another celestial-body-sized character into this? There’s a weirdly large number of them out there.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Hey, I just read <em>All-Star Superman</em> for the first time recently! (Funny when you learn of something and then it feels like it’s everywhere.) It liked it; maybe I should read <em>All-Star Batman &amp; Robin the Boy Wonder</em> next…</p>",
