      {
        "id": 265034,
        "name": "Chief Lackey Rich",
        "username": "Chief_Lackey_Rich",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/6de8d8/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2026-02-04T04:23:10.675Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"fjur\" data-post=\"75\" data-topic=\"29635\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/fjur/48/4849_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> fjur:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>And yes, I was already aware of <em>All-Star Batman</em>’s infamous reputation; my prior mention of it was pretty much just a joke, hence the ellipsis. : )</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I’m still annoyed that Miller’s dreadful work there probably led to the premature shutdown of the All-Star imprint, which cost us at least the Wonder Woman, Batgirl, and Green Lantern mini-series.  They probably wouldn’t have lived up to A-S Superman (which really was something special) but we’ll never know now, will we?</p>",
